00:08:44.101 --> 00:08:45.145
CHECKS INSTEAD.

00:08:45.179 --> 00:08:47.248
THAT IS NOT THE COUNTRY WANTS TO

00:08:47.282 --> 00:08:47.995
LIVE IN THOUGH.

00:08:47.996 --> 00:08:49.089
&gt;&gt; 177.

00:08:49.123 --> 00:08:49.987
I’VE ALWAYS WORKED.

