00:08:58.518 --> 00:08:59.955
WELL, I DON’T WANT FOOD STAMPS.

00:08:59.989 --> 00:09:01.321
I WANT TO WORK.

00:09:01.323 --> 00:09:03.634
WHEN OUR GOVERNOR SAID, WE WILL

00:09:03.668 --> 00:09:05.398
HAVE ANOTHER 28 DAYS, I WENT TO

00:09:05.432 --> 00:09:06.273
MY KNEES.

00:09:06.308 --> 00:09:08.282
I CAN’T TAKE ANOTHER 28 DAYS.

00:09:08.317 --> 00:09:11.161
ALL OF US AS AMERICANS NEED TO

00:09:11.196 --> 00:09:13.343
BEGIN TO TAKE RESPONSIBILITY FOR

00:09:13.344 --> 00:09:13.751
OURSELVES.

00:09:13.752 --> 00:09:14.214
YOU KNOW?

00:09:14.248 --> 00:09:17.692
I FEEL THAT THE GOVERNMENT IS

00:09:17.726 --> 00:09:19.351
NOT MY MOTHER, NEVER HAS BEEN,

00:09:19.353 --> 00:09:21.527
YOU KNOW, AND MATTER OF FACT,

00:09:21.528 --> 00:09:23.333
THIS ADMINISTRATION FOR THE MOST

00:09:23.334 --> 00:09:25.280
PART, I’VE BEEN IN BUSINESS

00:09:25.315 --> 00:09:26.464
LONGER THAN THEY’VE BEEN ALIVE.

00:09:26.499 --> 00:09:27.762
&gt;&gt; Tucker: GRETCHEN WHITMER

00:09:27.797 --> 00:09:29.958
