00:09:29.959 --> 00:09:32.678
THE GOVERNOR IS NOT MY MOM?

00:09:32.713 --> 00:09:33.994
MISOGYNY, BY THE WAY, CUTTING

00:09:33.995 --> 00:09:35.296
HERE IS RACIST.

