SO THE ADMINISTRATION TRIED TO

00:09:36.779 --> 00:09:38.383
SHUT HIM DOWN WITH A COURT ORDER

00:09:38.417 --> 00:09:39.412
BECAUSE THERE’S NOTHING ELSE

00:09:39.447 --> 00:09:40.891
GOING ON IN MICHIGAN RIGHT NOW.

00:09:40.925 --> 00:09:44.343
A JUDGE RESISTED THAT IT WAS TOO

00:09:44.377 --> 00:09:44.890
