00:09:47.199 --> 00:09:47.890
LICENSE.

00:09:47.925 --> 00:09:51.102
NOW, HE IS SHUT DOWN FOR GOOD

00:09:51.103 --> 00:09:53.041
AND WILL BE EVEN WHEN THE

00:09:53.075 --> 00:09:54.985
